WEBVTT

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:37.280
So that's the survey bridge...

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:43.690
Giuse-san! Look!

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:54.780
Amid the difficulty of
sticking to that one feeling,

00:00:54.780 --> 00:01:09.890
I want to protect you and fulfill
my promise to the only one for me

00:01:09.890 --> 00:01:17.300
In a world filled with doubt,
I still can't find the answer

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:24.540
Even so, I continue forward... Why?

00:01:24.540 --> 00:01:34.780
If I can change this dream-like
reality with my own two hands,

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:42.390
amid the difficulty of
sticking to that one feeling,

00:01:42.390 --> 00:01:50.060
I want to protect the only one for me

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:57.870
I swear on my beating heart I will
continue to run until I burn away

00:01:57.870 --> 00:02:05.280
Amid the eternal love I feel simply by living,

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:14.210
I want to fulfill my promise

00:02:32.940 --> 00:02:35.440
There doesn't seem to
be any security over here.

00:02:35.440 --> 00:02:37.110
Where is Pinocchio?

00:02:37.110 --> 00:02:40.770
Up above, watching
what's happening on land.

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:46.890
How much longer?

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:51.480
About 15 minutes to set them all up...

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:04.740
We've been spotted!

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:07.210
Franco! Let's take the boat and leave!

00:03:07.210 --> 00:03:08.480
But...!

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:10.640
Security will be here in a minute!

00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:15.410
Besides, what we've planted
already might be enough to destroy it!

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:19.350
Giuse-san! I've found the enemy!

00:03:19.350 --> 00:03:22.820
I'll be right there! Slow them down!

00:03:22.820 --> 00:03:24.420
Yes, sir!

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:52.980
Henrietta!

00:04:02.030 --> 00:04:04.460
Get ready!

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:25.080
Franco!

00:04:44.940 --> 00:04:47.100
Henrietta!

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:50.010
Giuse-san!

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:54.240
Let's run back to land!

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:13.640
"The Fighting Puppet"

00:05:37.220 --> 00:05:39.260
Are you okay, Franco?

00:05:39.260 --> 00:05:44.060
Yeah. The painkillers have set in.

00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:55.300
Franco... I'm sorry.

00:05:57.480 --> 00:06:00.050
It's because I hesitated to shoot...

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:03.040
Hesitated?

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:07.820
The first time I killed someone...

00:06:07.820 --> 00:06:14.420
...I shot a little girl who
just happened to be there...

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:25.870
Pointing a gun at little girls scares me...

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:36.880
I can't be like this,
if I'm going to get stronger...

00:07:20.230 --> 00:07:22.400
The bullet's still in there.

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:25.000
I'll be fine until morning.

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:28.960
I called for a doctor from Rome.

00:07:37.980 --> 00:07:40.150
I guess it didn't collapse...

00:07:40.150 --> 00:07:45.810
I guess not.
What's going to happen to Cristiano?

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:52.330
If the elders haven't made their move yet,

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:55.490
he might still have a chance.

00:07:58.730 --> 00:08:03.500
We have to tell Pinocchio...

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:07.170
Yeah, we do.

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:40.430
Hey, Pino!

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:42.600
Good morning, Domenico.

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:45.110
You're up early. Heading out?

00:09:45.110 --> 00:09:46.140
Yeah.

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:51.010
Come back before autumn!
That's the harvest season!

00:09:51.380 --> 00:09:55.440
Yeah! I will!

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:26.680
Well, he left.

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:28.650
Yeah.

00:10:28.650 --> 00:10:31.780
Sad he's gone?

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:35.450
Yeah.

00:10:37.590 --> 00:10:44.260
And you had just started to
talk more often. What a shame.

00:11:10.220 --> 00:11:15.060
"Montalcino, Tuscany region"

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:27.590
Triela.

00:13:27.590 --> 00:13:30.100
We need to be going.

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:32.430
Yes, sir.

00:13:33.230 --> 00:13:37.300
I hear Pinocchio is Cristiano's confidant.

00:13:37.300 --> 00:13:40.030
I'm sure we'll run into him again.

00:13:42.580 --> 00:13:45.270
I hope so.

00:13:46.980 --> 00:13:50.450
You can fight to your heart's
content when the time comes.

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:54.520
But dying won't solve
anything, just so you know.

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:57.350
Yes, Hirscher-san.

00:14:31.630 --> 00:14:32.830
Sir...

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:34.830
What is it?

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:38.100
Pinocchio is here.

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:39.620
What?

00:14:50.710 --> 00:14:52.980
Why have you come here?

00:14:52.980 --> 00:14:54.350
Uncle!

00:14:54.350 --> 00:14:59.120
I don't remember calling for you. Leave.

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:01.090
I came to help you, Uncle!

00:15:01.090 --> 00:15:05.160
Help? I don't need any.

00:15:05.160 --> 00:15:10.130
Franca told me!
Are the police really coming for you?!

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:14.940
You damaged the bridge.
It's too early to know what will happen.

00:15:14.940 --> 00:15:19.270
Then can't you hide out somewhere?!

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:24.300
I've lost many men this past half-year.

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:33.720
I will take responsibility
for our failures if need be.

00:15:33.720 --> 00:15:35.850
You can't be serious!

00:15:38.360 --> 00:15:43.160
If the police show up,
you're just going to let them arrest you?!

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:47.300
Since yesterday, I've been
thinking about what to do with you

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:50.390
when that time comes.

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:56.310
I don't want to leave you, Uncle!

00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:58.310
I'm going to fight here!

00:15:58.310 --> 00:16:02.750
No. You must leave this place.

00:16:02.750 --> 00:16:04.310
No!

00:16:10.490 --> 00:16:12.990
Why won't you listen to me?

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:16.360
Because I love you, Uncle!

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:36.080
You saved my life!

00:16:36.080 --> 00:16:39.450
You let me out of that
basement room and gave me a name!

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:43.090
It was just a whim!
I saved you on a whim, too!

00:16:43.090 --> 00:16:48.360
Why else would I have
given you a name like that?!

00:16:58.770 --> 00:17:01.710
If you're not going to leave...

00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:04.540
...then I'll kill everyone who comes here!

00:17:16.790 --> 00:17:21.190
Cristiano's mansion
is on this mountainside.

00:17:21.190 --> 00:17:22.830
There are two access roads.

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:27.430
To the east is a gas station,
which serves as a lookout post.

00:17:27.430 --> 00:17:30.170
Hirscher and I will
neutralize it and continue.

00:17:30.170 --> 00:17:35.340
Marco will take the west
route and block the road.

00:17:35.340 --> 00:17:39.800
Hirscher's fratello and my
fratello will infiltrate the mansion.

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:45.020
Capture Cristiano and
neutralize anyone still there.

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:49.960
Hey, Angelica. It's been a long
time since we've had a job together!

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:51.690
Yeah!

00:17:51.690 --> 00:17:52.960
Let's try our best!

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:57.690
Yeah! I'll try hard to
be useful to Marco-san!

00:19:04.560 --> 00:19:05.800
Angelica.

00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:08.230
Yes, Marco-san?

00:19:08.230 --> 00:19:10.900
Set up the Steyr on the roof of the car.

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:12.670
Understood!

00:19:27.350 --> 00:19:28.320
Angelica!

00:19:28.320 --> 00:19:30.420
Yes, Priscilla-chan?

00:19:30.420 --> 00:19:34.290
How are you feeling? All right?

00:19:34.290 --> 00:19:36.800
Yes!

00:19:36.800 --> 00:19:39.660
Umm...

00:19:41.470 --> 00:19:43.470
- Priscilla.
- Eh?

00:19:43.470 --> 00:19:45.410
Hurry with the barricades.

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:49.470
Oh! Yeah! Right!

00:19:58.650 --> 00:20:03.420
It seems Pinocchio won't be leaving.

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:11.320
I never sent him to school,
and I raised him as a killer...

00:20:11.970 --> 00:20:16.370
...yet, he said he loves me.

00:20:16.370 --> 00:20:19.360
Oh, did he?

00:20:19.670 --> 00:20:22.110
I don't get it.

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:28.310
I've never understood why he
doesn't hate me for these past 10 years.

00:20:28.310 --> 00:20:34.340
He has his own unique
reason for loving you.

00:20:37.860 --> 00:20:41.360
And, if you'll excuse me for saying,

00:20:41.360 --> 00:20:47.730
I could sense your own
unique brand of love for him, too.

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:52.740
You wanted to treat him as your own son...

00:20:52.740 --> 00:20:58.180
You just didn't know how to
go about doing it. That's all.

00:21:14.490 --> 00:21:19.990
He probably won't leave
this place unless I flee...

00:21:31.110 --> 00:21:33.410
Alessio.

00:21:34.880 --> 00:21:36.910
Yes, sir?

00:21:39.050 --> 00:21:42.180
Ready the car.

00:21:43.360 --> 00:21:47.420
Just to be safe, I'm
going to escape overseas.

00:22:51.520 --> 00:22:52.960
Triela!

00:22:52.960 --> 00:22:56.360
Everything's all right. Let's go.

00:23:09.140 --> 00:23:11.470
Pinocchio!

00:23:13.550 --> 00:23:17.070
The girl from Montalcino...

00:23:18.750 --> 00:23:21.910
I won't let you live this time.

00:23:25.430 --> 00:23:27.120
Give me your best shot!

00:23:46.080 --> 00:24:01.030
A doll without a heart,
born from warm hands

00:24:01.030 --> 00:24:10.500
I neither smile nor talk

00:24:10.500 --> 00:24:18.610
I want you to hear about
these feelings someday,

00:24:18.610 --> 00:24:26.650
though they can't be put into words

00:24:26.650 --> 00:24:34.830
I'll summon all my strength

00:24:34.830 --> 00:24:51.510
to know what it means to live

00:25:02.320 --> 00:25:07.220
"And So Pinocchio
  Becomes Human"
